WEBVTT

00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:42.320
Hold the neverending light.

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:46.600
Light the man over there.

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:51.470
Impart unto him the power of eternity from the ancients.

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:12.520
You sure caused us some trouble.

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:16.560
It's a fine thing, being able to die without anyone knowing.

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:22.230
We'll put you out of your misery real quick.

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:38.480
What the...

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:45.520
Bastard!

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:25.300
I feel like it'll disappear...

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:31.030
...the instant I look away.

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:36.170
I just kept counting...

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:41.610
...all the many traces of loneliness...

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:48.980
...that I'd vomited up.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:54.920
In this time that seems so dry,

00:03:54.860 --> 00:04:00.030
...my heart is thrashing around and drowning.

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:05.890
It takes those lies that make my head spin...

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:08.940
...and tears them to pieces.

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:18.610
 And the place I lose my way in...

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:26.440
...is a dim, hazy world.

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:07.160
This is pretty strange.

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:09.770
The Factory doesn't usually jump into action this quickly.

00:05:10.270 --> 00:05:12.100
It was a tip from the police.

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:15.500
They've got a gentlemen's agreement with the cops? That's REALLY strange.

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:19.040
It's just because they've got a standing agreement to cooperate with us.

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:21.610
That's just a front they put up, right?

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:25.080
Deep down, they really think of us as a big nuisance.

00:05:25.690 --> 00:05:28.660
If you've go so much to gripe about, why don't you tell the Factory to their face?

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:31.850
Where are Amon and the others?

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:33.660
They're already on-site.

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:34.750
Oh.

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:40.900
Just take that tape down!

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:42.670
You were saying about the victim's condition?

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:45.840
He's more injured internally than externally?

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:46.910
Yeah.

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:48.500
Hey, don't drop that!

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:50.870
Was a Witch behind this?

00:05:52.010 --> 00:05:53.820
I'm pretty sure of it.

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:54.750
"Pretty" sure?

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:57.770
Records show a case in the past that's similar to this one.

00:05:58.090 --> 00:06:01.110
That one was a Witch with the ability to generate microwaves,

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:04.960
...so the person behind this one is probably an individual with the same power.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:05.620
Hey!

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:09.590
Stop touching everything! We still need to process the scene!

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:21.410
Are you alone?

00:06:21.410 --> 00:06:24.340
No, but with the roads here being like this...

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:25.980
Where's the victim?

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:28.610
They're just about to start their investigation. You want to watch?

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:31.680
Thanks, but I'll pass.

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:57.040
So, this Witch is like some kind of electric eel.

00:06:57.580 --> 00:06:58.650
You could say that.

00:06:58.650 --> 00:07:02.080
There was apparently a Witch in the past with the same power.

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:06.720
22 years ago... It's a bit old, but looking at the case,

00:07:06.720 --> 00:07:08.720
...it's basically the same as what we have now.

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:10.660
Why don't we just follow his bloodline, then?

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:15.330
The genetic likelihood of powers being passed down is relatively high, right?

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:17.500
It doesn't look like that'll work.

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:20.200
Unlike hunts today, the ones back then were...

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:24.040
So we can assume that he never had any kids.

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:26.470
What about the possibility of another type?

00:07:26.470 --> 00:07:28.080
There's actually something going on,

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:29.880
...so if we try the STN databank...

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:29.610
What's that?

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:31.310
I'm doing that.

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:32.350
I found it at the scene.

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:34.920
But the STN databank isn't perfect.

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:33.950
The scene?

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:36.380
You took something without asking?!

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:37.420
There are a lot of unknowns here, especially...

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:37.720
That's bad?

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:39.050
...when dealing with power manifestations.

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:39.050
What do you think?!

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:48.790
The Witch most likely hasn't moved out of that area.

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:52.530
For now, all we can do is go over everything with a fine-tooth comb.

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:55.230
What, in that labyrinth?!

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:57.830
I'll admit that it would be hopeless in most cases.

00:07:58.070 --> 00:08:00.700
But what we're looking for isn't an ordinary human.

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:27.790
150,000 people...

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:32.900
I'm amazed that so many people can live in such a small area.

00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:35.980
Maybe this really is impossible.

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:38.950
This is like looking for a needle in a haystack.

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:41.240
Witches are solitary creatures.

00:08:42.220 --> 00:08:46.090
Normal humans would be able to hide inside the haystack.

00:08:46.550 --> 00:08:48.350
But Witches can't do that.

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:51.280
It always proves to be their downfall.

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:06.160
Do that all you want, you won't find whoever it is you are looking for.

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:10.940
You know what I'm trying to do?

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:17.040
When you get older, you learn to see a few things.

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:19.410
When you get older...

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:21.880
So much that it's amazing.

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:27.560
How amazing...

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:28.360
What?

00:09:28.930 --> 00:09:30.070
Nothing...

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:34.830
Besides, you aren't from around here, are you?

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:40.760
Then you ought to hurry out of here as fast as you can go.

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:43.310
I'm not in any danger.

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:46.680
That's true, you wouldn't be.

00:09:46.680 --> 00:09:49.740
But I can't say the same for those around you.

00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:51.980
Those around me?

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:02.520
I'm sorry, it looks like I'll have to stay here for a while.

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:05.260
'Bye.

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:24.050
Where's the victim?

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:32.390
Looks like the locals carried him off.

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:34.620
It's that kinda place, right?

00:10:46.140 --> 00:10:49.170
In any case, we can't do anything strange until our backup arrives.

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:55.580
Do you sense anything?

00:10:57.790 --> 00:11:03.050
I felt a huge psychic burst earlier, but there's nothing now...

00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:19.170
It's the same as the last one, isn't it?

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:23.990
A third victim, huh?

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:28.930
This one happened in broad daylight, so there ought to be some witnesses.

00:13:29.900 --> 00:13:34.600
If this case drags on much longer, it'll be hard to keep the police out of this.

00:13:38.650 --> 00:13:39.580
Any luck?

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:44.240
None at all. The people here won't say a word to somebody like me.

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:46.220
What about Dojima and Robin?

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:48.220
They're with the Factory techs.

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:50.630
Something about checking up on a light bulb.

00:13:50.630 --> 00:13:51.560
A light bulb?

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:53.790
The ones they found at the scenes, I think.

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:04.100
What's with him?

00:14:07.340 --> 00:14:10.680
What I want you to see is this scorch mark here above the paraffin.

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:13.310
This was just made just recently.

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:16.610
In other words, you're saying it was burned in there by the Witch's powers?

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:18.620
It was indirectly,

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:22.160
...but I'd say that induction current from the microwaves emitted by the Witch...

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:23.990
...caused light bulbs that were probably disconnected to light up,

00:14:23.990 --> 00:14:26.560
...resulting in a char pattern like this.

00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:29.000
Can we just think of it as an amazing power?

00:14:29.530 --> 00:14:30.460
I guess.

00:14:30.900 --> 00:14:32.600
That's not all.

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:37.630
It's probably safe to assume that this Witch isn't completely in control of his powers yet, either.

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:41.880
Just like Robin.

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:45.330
Otherwise, we wouldn't be seeing collateral damage like this.

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:47.920
Is that you, Amon?

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:50.080
Michael, what are you doing now?

00:14:50.690 --> 00:14:52.890
I'm running background checks on the victims. Why?

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:56.350
That can wait. I have something urgent for you to look into.

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:57.650
Like what?

00:14:58.190 --> 00:14:59.920
The power controls at the crime scenes.

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:03.890
Check to see if there were any irregular voltage spikes.

00:15:04.370 --> 00:15:05.800
If you want, sure, but...

00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:08.430
Hurry. Get to work on it immediately.

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:40.400
The first victims were people who were chasing after him for some reason,

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:43.100
...but the third one was probably a local.

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:45.510
In other words, you're saying that he's cornered...

00:15:45.510 --> 00:15:47.630
...and he's started lashing out at innocent bystanders?

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:51.510
He probably perceives everyone around him as an enemy right now.

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:54.610
Found it!

00:15:55.320 --> 00:15:56.720
Amon, it's right here!

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:58.650
Some tremendous voltage is being generated there!

00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:00.210
Looks like it's underground.

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:01.180
Sakaki.

00:16:02.990 --> 00:16:06.820
I got the map data. We just need to follow this to the killer, right?

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:08.620
That's right. Get moving.

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:11.620
This isn't a vespa, so hold on tight!

00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:43.490
I don't know how you took out my friends, but this is the end of the line.

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:39.920
S-Spare me!

00:17:39.920 --> 00:17:43.520
I was just hired, that's all! By the gang that's after you!

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:50.260
H-Hey, I know! You want to get out of here, right?

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:52.930
Then you'll need someone to guide you...

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:56.630
You know what it's like, right? This place is a deathtrap!

00:17:57.200 --> 00:17:58.430
They take outsiders, and they...

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:01.910
Please! Don't kill me!

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:05.250
Please! Please! Please!

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:09.380
Humans, huh...

00:18:19.830 --> 00:18:21.100
Who are you?!

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:23.930
Was it you?! You're the one who's behind these killings?!

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:24.850
Robin!

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:47.000
Sakaki here. The Witch has been hunted.

00:20:31.030 --> 00:20:34.650
Huh? Amon, you're here by yourself?

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:37.360
Yes.

00:20:37.570 --> 00:20:39.470
Why are you here at this hour?

00:20:39.470 --> 00:20:41.730
I stayed late over at the Master's place.

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:43.540
How about you, Amon?

00:20:43.540 --> 00:20:48.300
Well, I was looking at the information that Michael turned up on today's Witch.

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:52.270
Today's Witch? What kind of person was he?

00:20:54.780 --> 00:20:57.720
Juzo Narumi, age 33.

00:20:58.590 --> 00:21:01.560
As it turns out, he really was a distant relative of the Witch that Michael mentioned.

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:05.660
So he was on the STN's list?

00:21:06.090 --> 00:21:07.250
Basically.

00:21:09.300 --> 00:21:10.700
It's strange, though.

00:21:11.600 --> 00:21:15.730
Someone with that much power should have been right at the top of the suspect list.

00:21:16.340 --> 00:21:19.700
Narumi basically hadn't shown any signs of his power until now.

00:21:20.240 --> 00:21:23.970
No sign...? Even though he had such an incredible power?

00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:27.080
That means he suddenly awakened to his Craft and...

00:21:29.820 --> 00:21:30.650
What is it?

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:33.550
Forget it, its nothing...

00:22:00.010 --> 00:22:06.080
In the end, the words of time proved too great a burden for you...

00:22:21.470 --> 00:22:24.530
As for YOU, though...

00:22:36.660 --> 00:22:44.650
Just how far back do I need to go?

00:22:44.470 --> 00:22:47.510
Tell me.

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:59.500
It's all so vivid that it hurts.

00:23:00.360 --> 00:23:09.390
The truth is, nothing can be shared,

00:23:09.070 --> 00:23:13.880
...so I never looked back.

00:23:15.150 --> 00:23:19.250
...all those promises...

00:23:21.190 --> 00:23:25.650
...inside me eventually...

00:23:24.940 --> 00:23:31.450
...gave up on that light from some other time,

00:23:30.650 --> 00:23:40.230
...like the light of a morning you can't return to.
